{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for StudyMate', 'description': 'Primary container for StudyMate implementation: Reviser is a frontend-only web application designed for students to upload study materials in PDF and Word (.docx) formats and simulate the generation of multiple-choice questions (MCQs) for revision. The app provides a user-friendly interface for file uploads, displays a simulated preview of extracted content, generates dummy MCQs, and presents them in an interactive quiz format with instant feedback. Optionally, users can download the MCQs as a PDF. All features are implemented using only frontend technologies, with no backend integration.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "File Upload Interface",\n      "description": "Allows users to select and upload .pdf and .docx files through a drag-and-drop or click-to-upload interface. Only these file types are accepted.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Simulated Content Extraction",\n      "description": "After a file is uploaded, displays a placeholder preview of extracted text to simulate backend processing.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Simulated MCQ Generation",\n      "description": "Generates and displays sample MCQs (dummy data) that appear to be derived from the uploaded document.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Interactive Quiz Format",\n      "description": "Presents MCQs in a quiz layout where users can select answers and receive immediate feedback (right/wrong).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Download MCQs as PDF",\n      "description": "Allows users to download the generated MCQs as a PDF using client-side JavaScript. (Optional feature)",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Clean, Student-Friendly UI",\n      "description": "Consistent, attractive, and accessible design theme suitable for students.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#000000",\n    "secondary": "#FBD46D",\n    "accent": "#F67280"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a centered card layout with a prominent app title at the top. Below, a file upload area supports drag-and-drop and click-to-upload for .pdf and .docx files. After upload, a two-column layout appears: the left side shows a simulated text preview, and the right side displays generated MCQs in a quiz format. Each MCQ is shown with options, and users receive instant feedback upon selection. A download button for MCQs as PDF is placed at the bottom right. The design uses soft backgrounds, rounded corners, and clear typography for a modern, student-friendly look."\n}'}",
